     3	// The MHPCO's reimbursement clauses: which share of a damage amount the office
     4	// reimburses, before it withholds its deductible. Each clause is keyed on an
     5	// attribute of the damaged item; absent any clause, damage is reimbursed in
     6	// full. These clauses change with the office's risk policy, independently of
     7	// the deductible and of how a claim is settled across several damages.
