     9	const FULL_SHARE = 1;
    10	
    11	// Damage to items of this enchantment level or above is reimbursed at half.
    12	const HALF_REIMBURSEMENT_ENCHANTMENT = 8;
    13	const HALF_SHARE = 0.5;
    14	
    15	// The office's dragon-material clause — "damage to dragon-material items is
    16	// fully reimbursed" — needs no rule of its own here, because it never changes
    17	// a share: below the half-reimbursement enchantment it grants the full share
    18	// that every damage already gets, and at or above it the half-reimbursement
    19	// clause expressly wins. Branching on material would therefore add a rule
    20	// that no claim can turn on. Should the office ever make the clause pay a
    21	// share of its own, that is where it would enter.
